request.description:
One customer by numeric ID. Required ability: customers:read. Single-record response: {data:{...}}; list filters do not apply.

Canonical route: GET /api/v1/customers/{customer}
Route name: api.v1.customers.show

One order without login credentials or payment secrets. Required ability: orders:read. Single-record response: {data:{...}}; list filters do not apply.

Canonical route: GET /api/v1/orders/{order}
Route name: api.v1.orders.show

Paid package order by its order ID. Non-subscription orders return 404. Required ability: orders:read. Single-record response: {data:{...}}; list filters do not apply. Stored date keys are buying_date and expiry_date (YYYY-MM-DD or null).

Canonical route: GET /api/v1/subscriptions/{order}
Route name: api.v1.subscriptions.show

One support conversation; fetch the separate paginated messages endpoint for messages. Required ability: support:read. Single-record response: {data:{...}}; list filters do not apply. Contains metadata only; no unpaginated messages expansion.

Canonical route: GET /api/v1/support/conversations/{conversation}
Route name: api.v1.support.conversations.show

Canonical route: GET /api/v1/site/products/{type}/{id}

Route name: api.site.products.show

Controller action: App\Http\Controllers\Api\PublicSiteController@product

